# Copied from node_modules at build time by tools/stage-media.js. It is
# vosk-browser's own build, byte for byte, and has to sit inside the extension
# because a webview cannot fetch script from anywhere else — but 5.6MB of a
# dependency does not belong in a public repo's history, where it could never
# be taken back out.
media/vendor/
